        "node_id": "n_8_af1a22",
        "thought_text": "Analyze the problem by focusing on the relationship between the total number of sand packs (n) and the height of the fence (H). Since the height of the fence limits the initial height of the sand pillars, we can explore how different distributions of sand packs across the spots affect the overall structure. This might reveal patterns or formulas to minimize the number of occupied spots.",
