        "node_id": "n_9_0fbe3e",
        "thought_text": "Explore the use of dynamic programming to build the sandcastle iteratively, starting from the height H and adjusting the heights of subsequent spots based on the remaining sand packs. By keeping track of the minimum number of spots required at each step, we can ensure that the final solution is optimal while adhering to the given constraints.",
