        "node_id": "n_11_7cfe94",
        "thought_text": "Implement a direct calculation approach to determine the minimum number of spots by iterating over possible values of k, starting from the smallest possible k that could accommodate the given n and H. This involves checking if the sum of a decreasing sequence starting from H can equal n without exceeding it.",
