        "thought_text": "Optimize the binary search approach by adjusting the bounds more intelligently. Instead of setting high to n + 1, consider setting it to a value derived from the sum formula of an arithmetic series, which is (k * (2*H + k - 1)) / 2. This should reduce unnecessary iterations and improve efficiency.",
